s may not develop, which would adversely affect the liquidity and their price.","section":"●Unfavorable conditions in our industry or the global economy, including as a result of certain catastrophic events, may disrupt our business, limit our ability to grow, and negatively affect our results of operations.","block":147,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-042080","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-09","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002097163","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2097163/000121390026042080/ea0285152-20f_xanadu.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5f9995d77a32012a4f226a536384b25f393ecdcb777b74bfe5c65751b4dcfbdb.bin","sha256":"5f9995d77a32012a4f226a536384b25f393ecdcb777b74bfe5c65751b4dcfbdb"}},{"id":"d5d6add8533f800a2f672673a03dc25436175295b723b4b3b0e1a7a3421666e3","quote":"●We have identified material weaknesses in our internal control over financial reporting.","context":"●Our dual class share structure will concentrate voting control and the ability to influence corporate matters with holders of Class A Multiple Voting Shares.","section":"●Unfavorable conditions in our industry or the global economy, including as a result of certain catastrophic events, may disrupt our business, limit our ability to grow, and negatively affect our results of operations.","block":148,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-042080","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-09","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002097163","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2097163/000121390026042080/ea0285152-20f_xanadu.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/5f9995d77a32012a4f226a536384b25f393ecdcb777b74bfe5c65751b4dcfbdb.bin","sha256":"5f9995d77a32012a4f226a536384b25f393ecdcb777b74bfe5c65751b4dcfbdb"}},{"id":"644f83711b4704d1dd5f60b86afcd3fcf1e34ac89a9a8d388c9c5823bdbcc2df","quote":"●The occurrence of